Nemesis is an [[Elite]] enemy found exclusively in [[Act 3]].

== Pattern ==
{{Intents|Nemesis}}

On its first turn has a 50/50 chance of using either {{Int|Nemesis|Tri Burn}} or {{Int|Nemesis|Tri Attack}}.

Afterwards it has ''approximately'' these chances:
* {{Int|Nemesis|Tri Burn}} (35% chance)
* {{Int|Nemesis|Tri Attack}} (35% chance)
* {{Int|Nemesis|Scythe}} (30% chance)

Cannot use {{Int|Nemesis|Tri Burn}} or {{Int|Nemesis|Scythe}} twice in a row. Cannot use {{Int|Nemesis|Tri Attack}} three times in a row.

== Found With ==

=== Act 3 ===
* Solo

== Lore ==

When completing the Act 3 event {{E|Sensory Stone}}, you 'recall' what appear to be memories regarding the pasts of the characters. The {{TS|green||TRIUMPH}} dialogue option may recall a battle between the [[Silent]] and the [[Nemesis]], and her reason for climbing the Spire.
<blockquote><div style="font-style:italic">{{TS|green|up|TRIUMPH}}<br>

The remains of a {{TS|purple|up|ghostly creature}} sink slowly into the mud before you, barely visible in the moonlight. You have proven yourself amongst your sisters.<br>

Standing victoriously, you wait in silence as the others ceremoniously place the {{TS|gold||creature's skull}} atop your head. The ritual has concluded.<br>

You head towards the Spire...</div></blockquote>

